.DS_Store
# JetBrains plugin (Gradle) build output — everything under build/ EXCEPT
# distributions/ (the packaged .zip, tracked so README can link a prebuilt
# download the same way the VS Code .vsix is). A bare `build/` ignore can't
# be re-included from deeper inside it (git won't descend into an excluded
# parent dir to evaluate negations), hence `build/*` + the negation.
client-jetbrains/build/*
!client-jetbrains/build/distributions/
client-jetbrains/.gradle/
client-jetbrains/.intellijPlatform/
client-jetbrains/.kotlin/
